    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "WebAssembly components",
      "source_hash": 15770841756237779800,
      "context_hash": 1368626310625636584,
      "translation": "WebAssembly 컴포넌트",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:24.493680Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "As with all programming, the goal of writing a component is to make new functionality available by building it out of existing functionality.",
      "source_hash": 14266291897412958541,
      "context_hash": 2025388906529127564,
      "translation": "모든 프로그래밍이 그러하듯, 컴포넌트를 작성하는 목표는 기존 기능을 바탕으로 새로운 기능을 사용 가능하게 만드는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:24.493680Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "A WebAssembly component runs on a _platform_, which may be a Web browser, a stand-alone runtime, or even an operating system (when compiling WebAssembly to an executable).",
      "source_hash": 17090983499277831889,
      "context_hash": 17774016065515031840,
      "translation": "WebAssembly 컴포넌트는 *플랫폼*에서 실행되며, 이는 웹 브라우저, 독립형 런타임, 또는 (WebAssembly를 실행 파일로 컴파일하는 경우) 운영체제일 수도 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component": "컴포넌트",
        "runtime": "런타임"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:24.493681Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "By running the component, the platform gains the functionality that the component implements.",
      "source_hash": 16633384695799275828,
      "context_hash": 12231570646112212254,
      "translation": "컴포넌트를 실행함으로써, 플랫폼은 해당 컴포넌트가 구현하는 기능을 얻게 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:24.493681Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "Likewise, the platform provides functionality that code in components can use to interact with the outside world.",
      "source_hash": 10584529427758880905,
      "context_hash": 12138821007016994810,
      "translation": "마찬가지로, 플랫폼은 컴포넌트 안의 코드가 외부 세계와 상호작용하는 데 사용할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "world": "월드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:24.493681Z",
      "issues": [
        "Term 'world' should be translated as '월드' but was not found in translation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "For example:",
      "source_hash": 4114854479619665730,
      "context_hash": 302438875087379743,
      "translation": "예를 들면:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:24.493681Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "A user of the component model can build a component that converts the system time to another time zone.",
      "source_hash": 14127052259395104117,
      "context_hash": 3848410610640795937,
      "translation": "컴포넌트 모델의 사용자는 시스템 시간을 다른 시간대로 변환하는 컴포넌트를 만들 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component model": "컴포넌트 모델",
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:24.493681Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "For the component to work as intended, the underlying platform must provide the component with a means to access the current system time and the system time zone.",
      "source_hash": 10999533573588014400,
      "context_hash": 13404254354848693995,
      "translation": "컴포넌트가 의도한 대로 동작하려면, 기반이 되는 플랫폼이 현재 시스템 시간과 시스템 시간대에 접근할 수 있는 수단을 컴포넌트에 제공해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:24.493681Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "APIs for building WebAssembly components",
      "source_hash": 12622143190204653592,
      "context_hash": 9118737784547134338,
      "translation": "WebAssembly 컴포넌트 빌드를 위한 API",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:24.493682Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "In general, a platform that runs components must provide well-defined APIs for accessing functionality that components need: for example, reading from standard input, accessing environment variables, or manipulating network sockets.",
      "source_hash": 13259595490784726658,
      "context_hash": 10947550755167921275,
      "translation": "일반적으로 컴포넌트를 실행하는 플랫폼은 컴포넌트가 필요로 하는 기능에 접근할 수 있도록 잘 정의된 API를 제공해야 합니다. 예를 들어 표준 입력 읽기, 환경 변수 접근, 네트워크 소켓 조작 등이 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:40.285827Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "It's useful to have a standard, shared set of APIs that WebAssembly components can depend on. [WASI](https://wasi.dev/) (the WebAssembly System Interface) is a standards-track specification that defines these APIs.",
      "source_hash": 14133576779969833735,
      "context_hash": 11019135086110648052,
      "translation": "WebAssembly 컴포넌트가 의존할 수 있는 표준적이고 공유된 API 집합을 갖추는 것은 유용합니다. [WASI](https://wasi.dev/) (WebAssembly System Interface)는 이러한 API를 정의하는 표준화 트랙 사양인 인터페이스입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interface": "인터페이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:40.285827Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "A system or platform may expose some or all of the WASI APIs to components.",
      "source_hash": 12605507853695634948,
      "context_hash": 14800097729302929337,
      "translation": "시스템이나 플랫폼은 WASI API의 일부 또는 전체를 컴포넌트에 노출할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:40.285828Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Status",
      "source_hash": 9185517500688108049,
      "context_hash": 2743079348795029452,
      "translation": "상태",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:40.285828Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The current stable release of WASI is [WASI 0.2.0](https://github.com/WebAssembly/WASI/pull/577), which was released on January 25, 2024.",
      "source_hash": 12393178237303804367,
      "context_hash": 12417990593408276773,
      "translation": "WASI의 현재 안정 릴리스는 2024년 1월 25일에 릴리스된 [WASI 0.2.0](https://github.com/WebAssembly/WASI/pull/577)입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:40.285828Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "WASI 0.2.0 is [a stable set of WIT definitions](https://github.com/WebAssembly/WASI/blob/wasi-0.2/docs/Preview2.md) that components can target.",
      "source_hash": 13828459081118726722,
      "context_hash": 4208443993033572093,
      "translation": "WASI 0.2.0은 컴포넌트가 대상으로 삼을 수 있는 [안정된 WIT 정의 집합](https://github.com/WebAssembly/WASI/blob/wasi-0.2/docs/Preview2.md)입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:40.285828Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:2",
      "source": "WASI proposals will continue to evolve and new ones will be introduced; however, users of the component model can now pin to any stable release >= `v0.2.0`.",
      "source_hash": 3951484660745493005,
      "context_hash": 14825534047220278880,
      "translation": "WASI 제안은 계속 발전할 것이며 새로운 제안도 도입될 예정입니다. 다만 컴포넌트 모델 사용자는 이제 `v0.2.0` 이상의 안정 릴리스에 고정할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component model": "컴포넌트 모델",
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:40.285828Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:3",
      "source": "The [WASI.dev roadmap](https://wasi.dev/roadmap) tracks upcoming releases.",
      "source_hash": 199118591168486283,
      "context_hash": 17067364038911222156,
      "translation": "[WASI.dev 로드맵](https://wasi.dev/roadmap)에서 예정된 릴리스를 확인할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:40.285829Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Contributing",
      "source_hash": 9218740636091294818,
      "context_hash": 9558729136510680083,
      "translation": "기여하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:40.285829Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "If you find a mistake, omission, ambiguity, or other problem, please let us know via [GitHub issues](https://github.com/bytecodealliance/component-docs/issues).",
      "source_hash": 10664721963279446068,
      "context_hash": 4592690635157279660,
      "translation": "오류, 누락, 모호함 또는 기타 문제를 발견하시면 [GitHub 이슈](https://github.com/bytecodealliance/component-docs/issues)를 통해 알려 주십시오.",
